{"seq":2,"slug":"nosql-databases","title":"NoSQL 数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/storage-and-databases/nosql-databases","wordCount":1106,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"nosql-数据库\">NoSQL 数据库</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NoSQL 针对关系型数据库在水平扩展、固定 Schema、高并发写入上的痛点，用四类数据模型给出互补方案——它不是替代品而是互补方案。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>键值存储</strong>：以唯一 key 存取 value，读写性能极高、扩展模型简单，典型是 Redis 的 String/Hash/List/Set/Sorted Set/Stream。</li>\n<li><strong>文档数据库</strong>：以 JSON-like 文档为单元、无需预定义 Schema，同一集合内结构可以完全不同，适合快速迭代。</li>\n<li><strong>列族数据库</strong>：行键 + 列族组织，无主节点、可调一致性、LSM-Tree 优化写入，适合 IoT、日志、时序数据。</li>\n<li><strong>图数据库</strong>：以节点和边为核心，多跳关系直接遍历边，性能只与局部图大小有关，而非随 JOIN 深度指数下降。</li>\n<li><strong>Polyglot Persistence</strong>：大型系统通常混合使用多种数据库，按访问模式而非技术偏好选型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-nosql\">为什么需要 NoSQL</h2><p>关系型数据库在处理结构化数据和复杂查询方面表现优异，但在某些场景下会遇到瓶颈：海量数据的水平扩展困难、固定 Schema 不适应快速变化的数据模型、高并发写入性能受限。NoSQL（Not Only SQL）数据库针对这些痛点提供了多种解决方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    NoSQL((NoSQL 数据库))&#10;    KV[键值存储&lt;br/&gt;Key-Value]&#10;    Doc[文档数据库&lt;br/&gt;Document]&#10;    Col[列族数据库&lt;br/&gt;Wide-Column]&#10;    Graph[图数据库&lt;br/&gt;Graph]&#10;&#10;    NoSQL --- KV&#10;    NoSQL --- Doc&#10;    NoSQL --- Col&#10;    NoSQL --- Graph&#10;&#10;    KV --&gt; KVEx[Redis, DynamoDB,&lt;br/&gt;Memcached]&#10;    Doc --&gt; DocEx[MongoDB, CouchDB,&lt;br/&gt;Firestore]&#10;    Col --&gt; ColEx[Cassandra, HBase,&lt;br/&gt;Bigtable]&#10;    Graph --&gt; GraphEx[Neo4j, Amazon Neptune,&lt;br/&gt;JanusGraph]\">graph TB\n    NoSQL((NoSQL 数据库))\n    KV[键值存储&lt;br/&gt;Key-Value]\n    Doc[文档数据库&lt;br/&gt;Document]\n    Col[列族数据库&lt;br/&gt;Wide-Column]\n    Graph[图数据库&lt;br/&gt;Graph]\n\n    NoSQL --- KV\n    NoSQL --- Doc\n    NoSQL --- Col\n    NoSQL --- Graph\n\n    KV --&gt; KVEx[Redis, DynamoDB,&lt;br/&gt;Memcached]\n    Doc --&gt; DocEx[MongoDB, CouchDB,&lt;br/&gt;Firestore]\n    Col --&gt; ColEx[Cassandra, HBase,&lt;br/&gt;Bigtable]\n    Graph --&gt; GraphEx[Neo4j, Amazon Neptune,&lt;br/&gt;JanusGraph]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"键值存储\">键值存储</h2><p>键值存储是最简单的 NoSQL 模型：通过唯一的 key 来存取 value。它的优势在于极高的读写性能和简单的扩展模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface KVStore {&#10;  get(key: string): Promise&lt;string | null&gt;;&#10;  set(key: string, value: string, ttl?: number): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  delete(key: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  increment(key: string): Promise&lt;number&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const SESSION_STORE_EXAMPLE = {&#10;  key: &#39;session:user:abc123&#39;,&#10;  value: JSON.stringify({&#10;    userId: &#39;abc123&#39;,&#10;    role: &#39;admin&#39;,&#10;    loginAt: &#39;2026-03-30T10:00:00Z&#39;,&#10;    expiresAt: &#39;2026-03-30T22:00:00Z&#39;,&#10;  }),&#10;  ttl: 43200,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const RATE_LIMIT_EXAMPLE = {&#10;  key: &#39;ratelimit:ip:192.168.1.1:minute&#39;,&#10;  operation: &#39;INCR + EXPIRE 60&#39;,&#10;  threshold: 100,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KVStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ttl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SESSION_STORE_EXAMPLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'session:user:abc123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    userId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loginAt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-03-30T10:00:00Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expiresAt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-03-30T22:00:00Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">43200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RATE_LIMIT_EXAMPLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ratelimit:ip:192.168.1.1:minute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  operation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INCR + EXPIRE 60'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Redis</strong> 是最流行的键值存储，它提供了远超简单 KV 的丰富数据结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>String</td>\n<td>缓存、计数器、分布式锁</td>\n<td>GET, SET, INCR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash</td>\n<td>对象存储、用户属性</td>\n<td>HGET, HSET, HGETALL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>List</td>\n<td>消息队列、时间线</td>\n<td>LPUSH, RPOP, LRANGE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Set</td>\n<td>标签、去重、交集运算</td>\n<td>SADD, SMEMBERS, SINTER</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sorted Set</td>\n<td>排行榜、延时队列</td>\n<td>ZADD, ZRANGE, ZRANK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stream</td>\n<td>事件流、消息队列</td>\n<td>XADD, XREAD, XGROUP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文档数据库\">文档数据库</h2><p>文档数据库以 JSON-like 文档为存储单元，无需预定义 Schema。每个文档可以有不同的结构，非常适合快速迭代的应用开发。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Product {&#10;  _id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  category: string;&#10;  price: number;&#10;  attributes: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  reviews: Array&lt;{&#10;    userId: string;&#10;    rating: number;&#10;    comment: string;&#10;    createdAt: Date;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;  tags: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const electronicsProduct: Product = {&#10;  _id: &#39;prod_001&#39;,&#10;  name: &#39;MacBook Pro 16&#39;,&#10;  category: &#39;electronics&#39;,&#10;  price: 2499,&#10;  attributes: {&#10;    brand: &#39;Apple&#39;,&#10;    cpu: &#39;M3 Max&#39;,&#10;    ram: &#39;36GB&#39;,&#10;    storage: &#39;1TB SSD&#39;,&#10;    display: &#39;16.2 inch Liquid Retina XDR&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  reviews: [&#10;    {&#10;      userId: &#39;user_123&#39;,&#10;      rating: 5,&#10;      comment: &#39;性能怪兽，开发利器&#39;,&#10;      createdAt: new Date(&#39;2026-03-15&#39;),&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;  tags: [&#39;laptop&#39;, &#39;apple&#39;, &#39;professional&#39;],&#10;};&#10;&#10;const clothingProduct: Product = {&#10;  _id: &#39;prod_002&#39;,&#10;  name: &#39;经典 T 恤&#39;,&#10;  category: &#39;clothing&#39;,&#10;  price: 29,&#10;  attributes: {&#10;    brand: &#39;Uniqlo&#39;,&#10;    sizes: [&#39;S&#39;, &#39;M&#39;, &#39;L&#39;, &#39;XL&#39;],&#10;    colors: [&#39;白&#39;, &#39;黑&#39;, &#39;灰&#39;],&#10;    material: &#39;100% 棉&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  reviews: [],&#10;  tags: [&#39;t-shirt&#39;, &#39;casual&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  _id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  category</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  attributes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reviews</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    rating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    comment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> electronicsProduct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  _id: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prod_001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MacBook Pro 16'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'electronics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  price: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2499</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attributes: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    brand: </s